{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Embark on a Fun Adventure with Gaspachi!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of Gaspachi in his first quest to recover his precious bottles of milk, which have been stolen by a mysterious thief. To succeed, you must solve 51 challenging levels filled with obstacles and enemies that will test your wits and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level will bring new challenges where you must push boxes, defeat enemies, and collect as many bottles of milk as possible. Do you have what it takes to overcome every challenge and face the thief head-on?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482170/extras/Listado_enemigos_.png?t=1743117595\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Beautiful and colorful pixel art</strong> that immerses you in a vibrant and charming world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Challenging and addictive gameplay</strong> with push mechanics\u2014you\u2019ll also have your powerful yarn balls to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc7e <strong>A variety of enemies</strong> that will test your dexterity and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>51 clever levels</strong> that will make you think before you act.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482170?t=1743117595","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482170?t=1743117595","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482170/8e17ea9723f5a8fd989ab7dacf734da002452e4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743117595","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482170/8e17ea9723f5a8fd989ab7dacf734da002452e4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743117595","cat